          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ndeto ya Yeova yambũkĩa, ĩkĩmbĩa, Nĩwĩtĩkĩtye nthakame nyingĩ mũno, na nĩwokitĩte makaũ manene: ndwĩaka nyũmba kwondũ wa syĩtwa yakwa, nũndũ nĩwĩtĩkĩtye nthakame nyingĩ ĩũlũ wa nthĩ metho makwa mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
