          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaaka nyũmba kwondũ wa syĩtwa yakwa; na akeethĩwa mwana wakwa, nakwa ngeethĩwa ĩthe wake; na ngalũlũmĩlya kĩvĩla kya ũsumbĩ kya ũsumbĩ wake kwa Isilaeli tene na tene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
