          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yu, mwana wakwa, Yeova ethĩwe naku; naku athimĩka, nokyaka nyũmba ya Yeova Ngai waku, o tondũ ũneenete ũndũ waku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ Yeova nakũnenge kĩlĩko na ũmanyi, na akũnenge wĩai ũndu wa Isilaeli; nĩ kana ũkwate mĩao ya Yeova Ngai waku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
